content.text:
The root cause is a slowdown in ts-route-service's own database calls. Its SQL spans to the route tables went from about 0.1 ms to 0.2–6.6 s, and the slowness spreads up through the services that call it to ts-ui-dashboard. The telemetry has no per-connection network metrics, and mysql and route-service CPU and memory are flat or lower than normal. That points to the database-call fault inside route-service rather than the network or mysql.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-route-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6 p50_ms, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1", "claim": "Route-service SQL client spans (SELECT ts.route_distances/route_stations) have p50 of about 5 ms and p95 of 400-650 ms, vs about 0.1 ms normal."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6 p50_ms FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1", "claim": "Normal period: route-service SQL client spans have p50 around 0.1-0.2 ms."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, attr_span_kind k, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6 p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2,3 ORDER BY p50_ms DESC", "claim": "Route-service server spans p50 rose to 200-5700 ms in the abnormal window, while normal p50 was about 2-6 ms."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, round(avg(value),4) avgv FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND metric IN ('k8s.pod.cpu.usage','k8s.pod.memory.usage') GROUP BY 1", "claim": "Route-service pod CPU and memory stay flat or lower than normal, so no resource saturation is behind the slowdown."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-route-service", "to": "ts-route-plan-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration,0.5)/1e6 callee_server_p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Route-plan calls to route-service take about 2.4 s at p50 in the abnormal period."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-plan-service", "to": "ts-travel-plan-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration,0.5)/1e6 callee_server_p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Travel-plan calls to route-plan take about 1.8 s at p50 in the abnormal period."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-plan-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('ts-travel-plan-service','ts-ui-dashboard') AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND span_name LIKE '%travelPlan%' GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY 1,2", "claim": "Travel-plan and dashboard travelPlan endpoints show p95 of about 100 ms to 3.5 s in the abnormal period."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-service", "to": "ts-basic-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration,0.5)/1e6 callee_server_p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-basic-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Basic-service calls to route-service take about 228 ms at p50 vs about 2 ms normal."}]},
    {"from": "ts-basic-service", "to": "ts-travel-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration,0.5)/1e6 callee_server_p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-travel-service' AND c.service_name='ts-basic-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Travel-service calls to basic-service take about 230 ms at p50 in the abnormal period."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('ts-travel-service','ts-ui-dashboard') AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND span_name LIKE '%trips/left%' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Travel trips/left endpoints show slowed p95 latencies in the abnormal period (about 46 ms to 3.3 s server-side)."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-service", "to": "ts-travel2-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration,0.5)/1e6 callee_server_p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-travel2-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Travel2-service calls to route-service take about 736 ms at p50 in the abnormal period."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel2-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('ts-travel2-service','ts-ui-dashboard') AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND span_name LIKE '%trips/left%' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Travel2 trips/left endpoints show p95 of about 49 ms to 5.1 s in the abnormal period."}]}
  ]
}
```

